 calibrated model of Amazon rainforest productivity based on leaf biochemical properties</article-title><source>Plant Cell Environ</source><volume>18</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>1129</fpage><lpage>1145</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/doi:10.1111/j.1365-3040.1995.tb00624.x">doi:10.1111/j.1365-3040.1995.tb00624.x</ext-link></citation></ref><ref id="bib25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Malhi</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Phillips</surname><given-names>O.L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Tropical forests and global atmospheric change: a synthesis</article-title><source>Phil. Trans. R. Soc. B</source><volume>359</volume><year>2004</year><fpage>549</fpage><lpage>555</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/doi:10.1098/rstb.2003.1449">doi:10.1098/rstb.2003.1449</ext-link><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15212102</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Malhi</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>An international network to understand the biomass and dynamics of Amazonian forests (RAINFOR)</article-title><source>J. Vegetat. Sci</source><volume>13</volume><year>2002</year><fpage>439</fpage><lpage>450</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/doi:10.1658/1100-9233(2002)013%5B0439:AINTMT%5D2.0.CO;2">doi:10.1658/1100-9233(2002)013[0439:AINTMT]2.0.CO;2</ext-link></citation></ref><ref id="bib27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mayaux</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Holmgren</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Achard</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Eva</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Stibig</surname><giv